  "goodToKnow": "Der Sachverstand is expertise or expert knowledge: mit viel Sachverstand, externen Sachverstand einholen. Der/die Sachverständige (declined like an adjective) is an expert or assessor, for example in court or after a car accident (der Kfz-Sachverständige). The government's economic advisers are the Sachverständigenrat, nicknamed die Wirtschaftsweisen. It has no plural."
